# Direct Connection URL (port 5432) — used for MIGRATIONS only (drizzle-kit)
# Mode: Session → Needed for drizzle-kit generate/push/migrate
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Database → Connection string → "Direct connection"
DATABASE_URL_DIRECT=""